# What a release archive carries. Zenodo's GitHub integration archives each
# release as `git archive` does, and honours export-ignore: the snapshot is
# the ledger (records, proofs, keys, genesis, index) plus the standalone
# verifier that reads it, not the CI, the test files or the lockfile.
.github/          export-ignore
.gitattributes    export-ignore
.gitignore        export-ignore
scripts/          export-ignore
package-lock.json export-ignore
vitest.config.mjs export-ignore
*.test.mjs        export-ignore
backfill-v1.done  export-ignore
